{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ!小津ジャン！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobJmthlf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちはこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4月６日の乃木坂46分TV☕️☕️\nありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "復帰後初めてカメラの前に立ったので\n緊張がマックス限界を超えていましたが\n同期のみんなが盛り上げてくれて\nリラックスすることができました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめまして、6期生です\nのステージが１年前だなんて！？\n緊張のドキドキも、楽しみなワクワクも\n昨日のことのように覚えています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月の14th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVEにも参加させて\nいただきます！\n精一杯頑張りますので\nよろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんとお会いできる日が楽しみです✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46として活動できる\n今の時間が幸せすぎて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Now"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Everyday が"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Wonderful！！で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おもしろいことがたくさん！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと夢見ていた生活を送っています🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんも一緒に楽しんでくれるといいな😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4月といえば🌸\n入学や就職など\n人生の転機が訪れることが多い月ですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大学デビュー？？なんて言葉もあったり？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたくし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津も"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イメチェンしました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobaC0N4F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "びっくりしたかな？\nどう？どう？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいい？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キャー🙈🙉🙊\n照れちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生では2年ぶりの前髪なのですが\n前回の前髪あり期間は1週間で終わったので\n今回は何週間もつか見ものです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪の扱いがわからない😂😂\n前髪の固め方を\nおしーえてー！おじーいさーん！\nおしーえてー！アルムのもみの木よー🌲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob1uWNWS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとーーーに\nイメージがチェンジして誰だか\nわからないと思いますが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "安心してください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も誰だかわかりません"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もだんだん慣れていくので\nみなさんもゆっくり慣れていってくれると\n嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングルの制服を着た\nアー写も公開されているので\nぜひチェックしてね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生曲「桜橋を教えてくれた」の\nMVが公開されています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなが楽しそうな\nとっても素敵なMVになっています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪がある"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "◯◯◯◯◯を"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ヒント"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このブログの太文字を見てみてね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日の配信を見たら\n私がなにを言いたいかわかるかも…？"}], "source": "official"}